![Approximate CPUE for GA & SC combined (added together) for brown shrimp by time period. Notice the vastly different reporting frequencies before about 2000.](process_ad_commercial_files/figure-pdf/fig-brnCPUEbyWave-1.pdf){#fig-brnCPUEbyWave}
:::
:::

